flowchart LR
  A[Before contract snapshot] --> P[Bounded local parser]
  B[After contract snapshot] --> P
  P --> N[Normalize paths operations params responses]
  N --> R[Compatibility rules]
  R --> E[Evidence ledger]
  E --> D{Merge decision}
  D -->|breaking| H[Human review required]
  D -->|additive or unchanged| O[Review rollout and ownership]
